{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台今日（15日）早上8時30分錄得氣溫22.8°C，相對濕度83%。本港地區今日天氣預測：大致天晴。日間乾燥，最高氣溫約27°C。吹輕微至和緩偏北風。展望未來一兩日雲量較多，但明日（16日）風勢較大。周三（17日）北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本周後期早晚普遍清涼。（天文台）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:13:19.243915+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:35:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:03:35.009457+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:33.376275+00:00","content_hash":"c2c8a26bcd65d81cb86787c77fb83f7988a1e80c17049751e6b2836b2b80c7ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}